Sprint 9 expanded the lab from basic detection creation into contextual security monitoring and SOC triage. The environment now supports analysis of suspicious process relationships, privilege changes, service installation, and command-interpreter network activity.

A standardized severity model and analyst triage worksheet were added to improve alert prioritization, investigation consistency, and documentation quality.

